        "text": "Base rate/reference class: the directly matching BLS Table 1 private-industry total-compensation qoq series averaged 0.87 percent over the nine reported quarters from 2024-Q1 through 2026-Q1, with the last four readings 1.0, 0.8, 0.7, and 0.9. That recent base rate is more relevant than the full post-2001 index history because the target is a first-print rounded quarterly change under the current labor-market and seasonal-adjustment regime."
